cff-version: 1.2.0
title: OpenCGM-StateEvent
message: >-
  An independent public-data reconstruction of the GlucoFM method. If you use this software,
  please cite both this reconstruction and the original paper referenced below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Fourdrinier
    given-names: Stephane
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/sfourdrinier/opencgm
abstract: >-
  A ~0.72M-parameter dual-stream foundation model for continuous glucose monitoring,
  reimplemented from the GlucoFM publication and trained on public CGM cohorts. Not
  affiliated with or derived from any Google implementation or checkpoint.
references:
  - type: article
    title: "GlucoFM: A Dual-Stream Foundation Model for Continuous Glucose Monitoring"
    url: https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.30865v2
    notes: >-
      Original method. This project reimplements it independently from the publication; no
      official source code or weights were available at the 2026-08-27 evidence cutoff.
